1
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:22,400
Mom

2
00:01:42,519 --> 00:01:45,439
Mom, Mom, Mom!

3
00:01:47,799 --> 00:01:48,920
I want to play downstairs.

4
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,879
There's a dog down there.

5
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:02,120
Just for a little while!

6
00:02:02,239 --> 00:02:03,719
It won't be dangerous.

7
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:06,560
Come with me.

8
00:02:08,159 --> 00:02:09,439
I have a lot to do.

9
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,439
Just a little while, okay?

10
00:02:12,639 --> 00:02:13,879
I'm not afraid of anything.

11
00:02:13,879 --> 00:02:16,240
Besides, it won't be dangerous.

12
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,919
I'm all grown up now.

13
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:19,639
I won't be scared.

14
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:20,719
Please?

15
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:21,840
Just for a tiny little bit!

16
00:02:21,840 --> 00:02:23,520
Just for a tiny little bit!

17
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,960
I already said no!

18
00:02:29,879 --> 00:02:30,800
Who are you talking to?

19
00:02:34,159 --> 00:02:34,759
No one.

20
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,199
Breakfast is ready.

21
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:51,560
Go downstairs and eat.

22
00:03:02,120 --> 00:03:03,639
When are you going to fix this light?

23
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:06,719
I've been too busy lately.

24
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:07,919
I'll fix it in a few days when I'm free.

25
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:11,360
Hello?

26
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:12,960
I don't care about that.

27
00:03:13,240 --> 00:03:14,719
I need the second female lead finalized today.

28
00:03:15,560 --> 00:03:16,800
Are you kidding me?

29
00:03:17,039 --> 00:03:17,840
We start filming today.

30
00:03:17,840 --> 00:03:19,240
How do I start without a second female lead?

31
00:03:20,759 --> 00:03:22,120
That's their problem to solve.

32
00:03:23,919 --> 00:03:25,159
Alright, alright, I...

33
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:28,080
I don't want to hear these excuses.

34
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:29,400
I need a solution.

35
00:03:30,159 --> 00:03:31,360
I'm heading out right now.

36
00:03:31,879 --> 00:03:33,080
Whatever the problem is,

37
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:34,199
let's discuss it in person.

38
00:03:34,759 --> 00:03:35,400
Okay, fine.

39
00:03:36,159 --> 00:03:36,680
Bye.

40
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,479
Still haven't found the second female lead?

41
00:03:44,639 --> 00:03:46,479
The Investors recommended a few before,

42
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:48,240
but they're no good. Just terrible.

43
00:03:48,360 --> 00:03:49,599
Then how about I give it a try?

44
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,199
I'm just kidding.

45
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,080
In my current condition,

46
00:03:58,639 --> 00:03:59,400
how could I possibly act?

47
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:03,599
No.

48
00:04:03,599 --> 00:04:05,400
I... I'm not worried about your condition.

49
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:07,080
I was just thinking,

50
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,240
if you really want to make a comeback,

51
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,479
it should definitely be as the female lead.

52
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:10,800
Why... why play the second female lead?

53
00:04:22,079 --> 00:04:22,720
By the way.

54
00:04:23,639 --> 00:04:25,720
I found a new Nanny today.

55
00:04:26,279 --> 00:04:27,160
She's coming over today.

56
00:04:27,519 --> 00:04:28,600
I told you I don't need one.

57
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:32,120
I know.

58
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,720
You don't like strangers in the house.

59
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,600
But since I'm not around,

60
00:04:36,240 --> 00:04:37,519
and you're home alone with Ran,

61
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,399
I just get worried.

62
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,519
Just let her come and help out.

63
00:04:40,879 --> 00:04:41,920
It's fine. If you don't like her,

64
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,160
just pretend she doesn't exist.

65
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,920
You saw the ones we hired before.

66
00:04:53,199 --> 00:04:54,160
They couldn't help at all.

67
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,199
No one can help me.

68
00:04:55,279 --> 00:04:56,399
Now, even you're the same.

69
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:57,560
No one can help me.

70
00:05:10,439 --> 00:05:11,480
Alright, alright.

71
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:14,680
Alright, alright, alright.

72
00:05:15,279 --> 00:05:16,079
Just relax.

73
00:05:16,839 --> 00:05:17,759
Deep breaths. Deep breaths.

74
00:05:19,279 --> 00:05:20,319
It's no big deal.

75
00:05:22,120 --> 00:05:23,040
Alright, alright, alright.

76
00:05:31,360 --> 00:05:32,000
I'm fine.

77
00:05:32,959 --> 00:05:33,680
You should go.

78
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:38,519
It's fine.

79
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:41,040
If you're not feeling well today,

80
00:05:41,079 --> 00:05:42,360
I can stay home with you.

81
00:05:45,199 --> 00:05:46,279
It's the first day we start filming,

82
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,399
you have to show up anyway.

83
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:50,759
To start filming isn't that important.

84
00:05:51,199 --> 00:05:53,079
What matters is I'm worried about you at home.

85
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,279
If you think you'll be fine at home,

86
00:05:56,279 --> 00:05:58,480
then I'll head out first, okay?

87
00:05:58,759 --> 00:05:59,759
Call me if you need anything.

88
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,720
It's fine. It's okay.

89
00:06:04,079 --> 00:06:05,399
Okay, okay.

90
00:06:05,399 --> 00:06:07,319
Anyway, I'll just... I'll head over there first.

91
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:09,399
Once I'm there, if you call me,

92
00:06:09,399 --> 00:06:11,079
I'll come back anytime.

93
00:06:15,839 --> 00:06:16,360
Okay.

94
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:17,639
Go back inside, it's too cold out.

95
00:07:29,759 --> 00:07:30,759
Mom.

96
00:07:30,879 --> 00:07:33,839
I'm so bored lying here all the time.

97
00:07:36,480 --> 00:07:38,759
These clothes are so pretty.

98
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:43,160
But they won't fit me soon.

99
00:07:43,480 --> 00:07:46,480
Mom, will you buy me new clothes?

100
00:07:50,319 --> 00:07:51,079
Mom.

101
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:52,959
This milk has a funny smell.

102
00:07:52,959 --> 00:07:54,079
It tastes awful.

103
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,600
I didn't mean to.

104
00:07:57,160 --> 00:07:59,160
Mom, are you sad?

105
00:07:59,439 --> 00:08:01,920
Why don't you smile, Mom?

106
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,040
I'm a little hungry, Mom.

107
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:06,639
Where's Dad, Mom?

108
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,959
Why didn't Dad take you out with him?

109
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:09,639
Mom.

110
00:08:09,879 --> 00:08:13,120
Mom. Mom. Mom.

111
00:08:40,039 --> 00:08:42,399
Mom, someone's here.

112
00:09:20,039 --> 00:09:21,600
Hello, I'm Jiang Jia.

113
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,559
Did you see a dog when you got here?

114
00:09:41,039 --> 00:09:41,919
I did.

115
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:43,559
Is it yours?

116
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:44,799
No idea whose it is.

117
00:09:46,679 --> 00:09:47,600
Flowers for you.

118
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:48,600
Thanks.

119
00:09:52,279 --> 00:09:53,200
What kind is this?

120
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:56,879
What?

121
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:01,320
I asked what kind of flower it is.

122
00:10:03,159 --> 00:10:03,879
Iris.

123
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:08,080
It's quite pretty.

124
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:10,000
First time seeing it.

125
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:39,039
Want something to drink?

126
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,480
Water, thanks.

127
00:10:41,159 --> 00:10:41,960
With some lemon.

128
00:10:42,840 --> 00:10:43,480
Okay.

129
00:10:59,639 --> 00:11:00,440
Thanks.

130
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:05,200
I didn't expect someone like you.

131
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:08,799
What did you expect?

132
00:11:10,519 --> 00:11:11,600
You're way too pretty.

133
00:12:05,279 --> 00:12:05,879
She's asleep.

134
00:12:08,279 --> 00:12:10,039
Your dress is beautiful.

135
00:12:19,080 --> 00:12:19,840
You...

136
00:12:22,799 --> 00:12:24,440
Can you hear her talking?

137
00:12:25,879 --> 00:12:26,519
Who?

138
00:12:32,320 --> 00:12:33,279
Xiao Ran.

139
00:12:37,320 --> 00:12:39,840
Honey, you're too impatient.

140
00:12:40,320 --> 00:12:41,440
She's still so little.

141
00:12:41,639 --> 00:12:43,120
How could she possibly talk?

142
00:12:44,440 --> 00:12:45,120
Let's go.

143
00:13:06,399 --> 00:13:07,159
Don't worry.

144
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:09,799
The cameras can see everything.

145
00:13:21,759 --> 00:13:22,759
You have great taste.

146
00:13:23,360 --> 00:13:24,519
This is my favorite bottle.

147
00:13:26,039 --> 00:13:27,279
I picked it just for you.

148
00:13:27,519 --> 00:13:28,519
You should relax a bit.

149
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:30,960
I don't think I should.

150
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:38,600
Don't worry, I'm here.

151
00:13:40,639 --> 00:13:41,720
I'll join you with this.

152
00:13:46,759 --> 00:13:48,360
You can't be this tense all the time.

153
00:13:53,039 --> 00:13:54,320
Do I look nervous?

154
00:13:56,159 --> 00:13:57,360
It's written all over your face.

155
00:14:08,000 --> 00:14:09,360
You're really good with kids.

156
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,440
You're so young.

157
00:14:13,279 --> 00:14:14,559
I was a bit skeptical at first.

158
00:14:15,120 --> 00:14:17,039
Young? I'm over forty.

159
00:14:17,440 --> 00:14:18,320
You're over forty?

160
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,360
You can't tell at all.

161
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:23,399
I've got a head full of gray hair.

162
00:14:25,279 --> 00:14:26,360
You have gray hair?

163
00:14:26,399 --> 00:14:27,159
Yeah.

164
00:14:27,519 --> 00:14:28,360
It keeps growing back.

165
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:29,639
I have to touch up my roots all the time.

166
00:14:56,559 --> 00:14:57,200
I...

167
00:14:58,159 --> 00:14:59,000
My phone.

168
00:15:01,279 --> 00:15:02,159
Excuse me.

169
00:15:09,480 --> 00:15:09,960
I...

170
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:10,759
Sure.

171
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,919
Looks like you really need to relax too.

172
00:16:08,879 --> 00:16:09,759
My boyfriend.

173
00:16:15,960 --> 00:16:17,159
We had a little fight.

174
00:16:18,759 --> 00:16:19,840
I'm falling apart.

175
00:16:21,039 --> 00:16:23,159
I've always had terrible taste in men.

176
00:16:23,919 --> 00:16:24,679
Unlike you.

177
00:16:26,840 --> 00:16:27,519
By the way,

178
00:16:28,919 --> 00:16:30,279
how did you and Lu Yuan meet?

179
00:16:31,840 --> 00:16:33,360
My boyfriend is his driver.

180
00:16:33,759 --> 00:16:34,600
Sun Hui?

181
00:16:34,679 --> 00:16:35,159
Right.

182
00:16:36,159 --> 00:16:37,240
Lu Yuan complained to him

183
00:16:37,240 --> 00:16:38,360
about having too many chores at home

184
00:16:38,399 --> 00:16:39,279
and needing someone to help.

185
00:16:39,279 --> 00:16:40,360
So he recommended me.

186
00:16:41,159 --> 00:16:41,840
Of course,

187
00:16:41,840 --> 00:16:43,320
I'm actually an actress.

188
00:16:43,679 --> 00:16:44,279
An actress?

189
00:16:45,519 --> 00:16:46,519
A struggling one.

190
00:16:46,519 --> 00:16:48,159
I haven't played any major roles.

191
00:16:48,360 --> 00:16:49,759
Why? Don't I look like one?

192
00:16:52,440 --> 00:16:53,679
That's not what I meant.

193
00:16:54,159 --> 00:16:55,200
I meant...

194
00:16:55,399 --> 00:16:56,480
I'm an actress too.

195
00:16:58,440 --> 00:16:59,320
I know.

196
00:16:59,879 --> 00:17:01,559
I've seen all your work.

197
00:17:07,039 --> 00:17:08,640
I somehow won an award.

198
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:11,319
I don't even know if I'm really that good.

199
00:17:13,359 --> 00:17:14,240
That's not true.

200
00:17:15,119 --> 00:17:16,599
I think your acting is amazing.

201
00:17:16,720 --> 00:17:17,839
That's what they all say.

202
00:17:18,799 --> 00:17:19,880
Just like you are right now.

203
00:17:22,039 --> 00:17:22,920
And then

204
00:17:28,720 --> 00:17:29,839
I actually start believing

205
00:17:30,400 --> 00:17:31,880
that I must be good enough.

206
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:07,960
The baby's probably hungry.

207
00:18:08,119 --> 00:18:10,680
Don't worry. It's normal for babies to cry.

208
00:18:14,799 --> 00:18:15,440
Answer your phone.

209
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,319
I'll go check on the baby.

210
00:18:25,759 --> 00:18:26,480
Hey, honey.

211
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:28,000
Sorry about that.

212
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,720
I just contacted the Nanny.

213
00:18:30,279 --> 00:18:31,319
I was just about to tell you.

214
00:18:31,319 --> 00:18:32,200
I think she's great.

215
00:18:36,440 --> 00:18:37,759
What's going on over there? It's so loud.

216
00:18:38,039 --> 00:18:38,599
It's nothing.

217
00:18:38,799 --> 00:18:39,920
We're rehearsing an action scene.

218
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:41,240
I just wanted to tell you,

219
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:42,359
I had some free time,

220
00:18:42,400 --> 00:18:44,000
so I contacted the Nanny.

221
00:18:44,480 --> 00:18:45,839
I wanted to go over a few things with her.

222
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,920
But she said she misread the message.

223
00:18:48,039 --> 00:18:49,119
She's only just leaving now.

224
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,079
You mean...

225
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:54,759
she's only just leaving now?

226
00:18:55,319 --> 00:18:57,319
Right. She said she'll get here as fast as she can,

227
00:18:57,319 --> 00:18:58,480
but it'll probably still be a while.

228
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,960
Mom, who is she?
